{"5190490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"One More Floor","steam_appid":5190490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5290050],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Floor is a short, risk-and-reward incremental game about riding an elevator down into the mines to collect multiplying riches!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through different mines to gather coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.poster.avif?t=1793725206\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.webm?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.mp4?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out your wealth or risk it all to reach the bottom!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats and abilities to survive the descent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.poster.avif?t=1793725206\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.webm?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.mp4?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, rewarding incremental progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique mines<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for multipliers, luck, and floor skips<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with permanent gem unlocks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet experience (~2-4 hours playtime)<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Floor is a short, risk-and-reward incremental game about riding an elevator down into the mines to collect multiplying riches!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through different mines to gather coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.poster.avif?t=1793725206\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.webm?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/6bb4118bca7d8b4c0858d01741c8bc76.mp4?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out your wealth or risk it all to reach the bottom!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats and abilities to survive the descent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.poster.avif?t=1793725206\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.webm?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/extras\/af6098b5a10a014c42882a31fd8c2ef5.mp4?t=1793725206\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, rewarding incremental progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique mines<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades for multipliers, luck, and floor skips<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with permanent gem unlocks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet experience (~2-4 hours playtime)<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"One More Floor is a short incremental game. Ride an elevator into the mines, hit the targets to multiply your coins each floor, and cash out before you die. Unlock new mines, collect rare gems, and buy permanent prestige upgrades.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Russian, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/78193c9a3da9038c8f76a1c05834782148b2b5f1\/header.jpg?t=1793725206","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/ede2f7d5cc0580c803378d305668b854efff7a51\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725206","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190490\/ede2f7d5cc0580c803378d305668b854efff7a51\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725206","website":"https:\/\/impress.games\/press-kit\/confused-quark\/one-more-floor","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><stron